# SecurePay MCP Server

# Background research

Understand this by using mcp brave-web-search

## SecurePay API Documentation (https://auspost.com.au/payments/docs/securepay/?javascript):

This is the official documentation for SecurePay's XML API
Contains critical information about:
API endpoints and request structure
Supported payment types and currencies
Error codes and response handling
Security requirements and PCI compliance

## Model Context Protocol Servers (https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers):

Reference implementation for MCP servers
Contains examples of:
Tool definition patterns
Input validation approaches
Error handling structures
API response formatting

## Phases

### Phase 1. Initial Setup

- Create new TypeScript MCP server project
- Set up basic server structure and configuration
- Implement environment variable handling for SecurePay credentials

### Phase 2. SecurePay Integration

- Implement API client for credit card processing
- Focus on essential endpoints:
  - Payment initialization
  - Payment processing
  - Transaction status checking
- Implement request/response builders
- Add error handling for API responses

### Phase 3. MCP Tools

- process_payment
- check_transaction
- get_transaction_history
